{"id": "DeeVia1ojf8", "title": "Video by adilet.fndr", "description": "If you’re a solo founder, being good at everything is what’s slowing you down 🧠\n\nYou’re doing sales, marketing, design, support and the weekly update nobody reads. All at once, all by yourself.\n\nDock gives you a team of AI agents instead:\n• A chief of staff who checks your goals every Monday and hands out the work\n• A designer for your launch graphics\n• An outreach agent who finds leads, checks their emails and writes to each one\n• A researcher who finds what your customers are searching for and writes around it\n\nEach one has a name, a memory of everything you’ve told them and their own calendar. They pass work to each other and only come to you when there’s a decision to make.\n\nAnd you can run all of it from iMessage. Just text your chief of staff.\n\nComment DOCK and I’ll send you the link 👇\n\n#solofounder #aiagents #startup #buildinpublic #saas", "channel": "adilet.fndr", "uploader_id": "26455618998", "uploader": "Adilet", "timestamp": 1791979414, "like_count": 917, "comment_count": 886, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1492747372710746a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 63.825, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fdac147-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPbTXi_ugNZrpEhKxy8hZVRzX5nFADEh3n0LVRLEfkg_rEMsda64vj9Wz8Xemr1e0meeqILJs0vuGDOAVPQLZKyteXxAZtDiWYoGvI.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=AdoHSMFzCYSGH_ThBy-1twPXBUEkG0LRGhiHam8Xnxkg-kVt1eS0_Ub7YTovWkG9yzs&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fdac147-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=ijJV-iZ7FEAQ7kNvwG6sJnZ&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=Cp59zq_vdKiBccYY